Package: perfinr
Type: Package
Title: Personal Finance Calculations for the Field Manual
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Martin", "Frigaard", , "mjfrigaard@pm.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Small, tested functions for the calculations in the personal
    finance field manual: budgeting, savings, emergency funds, debt payoff,
    loans and mortgages, investing, retirement accounts, insurance, and
    federal income taxes.
